        <briefdescription>
<para>Initialize an Active Object and bind its scheduler task slot. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Pass <computeroutput>&amp;tasks[i]</computeroutput> from the contiguous task array managed by <computeroutput><ref refid="structSYN__Sched" kindref="compound">SYN_Sched</ref></computeroutput> so <computeroutput><ref refid="syn__ao_8h_1a63fca36035b6ea1c1e59d0546f4d4351" kindref="member">syn_ao_post()</ref></computeroutput> wakes the exact task descriptor executed by the scheduler. Because <computeroutput><ref refid="structSYN__Mailbox" kindref="compound">SYN_Mailbox</ref></computeroutput> reserves one ring slot as full/empty sentinel, <computeroutput>mailbox_cap</computeroutput> must be at least 2 and stores up to <computeroutput>mailbox_cap - 1</computeroutput> queued events.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ao</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Active Object instance. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>task</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Caller-owned scheduler task slot (e.g. <computeroutput>&amp;tasks[i]</computeroutput>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>name</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Name of the active object (used for task/logging). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>priority</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Cooperative task priority (<computeroutput><ref refid="syn__task_8h_1a1d7f21a7e18ec1402e0cd4c54a625269" kindref="member">SYN_Prio</ref></computeroutput>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>transitions</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Transition table for the internal state machine. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>initial_state</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Initial state of the state machine. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>mailbox_buf</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Buffer backing the mailbox event queue (<computeroutput><ref refid="structSYN__AO__Event" kindref="compound">SYN_AO_Event</ref>[mailbox_cap]</computeroutput>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>mailbox_cap</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Allocated slot count of <computeroutput>mailbox_buf</computeroutput> (must be &gt;= 2). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
