    <briefdescription>
<para>Active Object (Actor model) framework wrapper. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Combines cooperative tasks, protothreads, mailboxes, and state machines to enforce strict event-driven encapsulation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
